-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":"Marketplace > Apps & mods is the store over these actions: cards with state, a details view (plain actions, what it asks for, promises, versions, source, manual), an enable switch, Update, Remove with an in-place confirm, and Add from source. Its rendered proof is the install, enable, open, disable and remove journey that scripts/mod_render.py drives through Obscura on the owned backend.","key":"5","section":"guidance"}
